---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---


<Layout
	title="Cookie Policy - One Nation"
	description="How One Nation Agency uses cookies on its website, and how you can control or withdraw your consent at any time."
	lang="en"
	canonical="/en/cookie-policy"
>
	<Header lang="en" />
	<main id="main-content">
		<section class="cookies">
			<div class="container">
				<h1>Cookie Policy</h1>

				<div class="cookies-content">
					<h2>This site sets no cookies</h2>
					<p>Verified: <strong>no cookie is placed</strong> on your device when you browse www.onenationagency.com, neither by us nor by any third party.</p>
					<p>The site uses <strong>no audience measurement tool</strong> (no Google Analytics, no Tag Manager, no Matomo), <strong>no advertising pixel</strong> (no Meta, no LinkedIn), <strong>no targeting cookie</strong> and <strong>no social media widget</strong>. The links to our social accounts are plain links: they load nothing until you click them.</p>

					<h2>What is stored in your browser</h2>
					<p>Only two items are kept locally, on your device. Neither is transmitted to anyone and neither identifies you.</p>
					<ul>
						<li><strong>ona_cookie_consent</strong>: records the choice you make in the privacy banner. This record is exempt from consent, since its only purpose is to remember that choice. It remains until you clear your browsing data.</li>
						<li><strong>ona_intro_seen</strong>: records that the intro animation has already played, so it is not replayed on every page. It disappears as soon as you close the tab.</li>
					</ul>

					<h2>Third-party services called by the site</h2>
					<p>Two external services are called when pages are displayed. Neither sets a cookie, but both receive your IP address, which is technically required for any connection.</p>
					<ul>
						<li><strong>Google Fonts</strong>: supplies the site's typefaces. Your IP address is transmitted to Google when pages load.</li>
						<li><strong>Cloudflare Turnstile</strong>: checks, on the contact page only, that the form is not being filled in by a bot. This service is cookieless and serves site security: it is exempt from consent.</li>
					</ul>

					<h2>So what is the privacy banner for?</h2>
					<p>It is not about cookies, but about one specific point: whether or not a summary of your conversation with the site's assistant may be emailed to One Nation Agency. Without your agreement, no summary is sent.</p>

					<h2>Change your consent</h2>
					<p>You can revisit your choice at any time, either way:</p>
					<p><button type="button" class="cookie-settings-btn" data-cookie-settings>Change my privacy preferences</button></p>

					<h2>Clear the data stored by the site</h2>
					<p>The two items described above can be removed from your browser settings, by clearing the site's browsing data. The site will remain fully functional: you will simply see the privacy banner and the intro animation again.</p>
					<p>For further reading, the French data protection authority publishes a guide on <a href="https://www.cnil.fr/en/cookies-and-other-tracers" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">cookies and other trackers</a>.</p>

					<h2>Changes</h2>
					<p>Should new services be added to the site, this page would be updated and, where required, your consent sought again.</p>

					<h2>Contact us</h2>
					<p>For any question on this subject: <a href="mailto:contact@onenationagency.com">contact@onenationagency.com</a></p>
					<p>See also our <a href="/en/privacy-policy">privacy policy</a>.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>
	<Footer lang="en" />
</Layout>

<style>
	/* Bouton de retrait du consentement — géré par CookieBanner.astro */
	.cookie-settings-btn {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		background: none;
		border: 1px solid rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.5);
		color: #C9A84C;
		font-family: inherit;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		padding: 0.7rem 1.4rem;
		border-radius: 8px;
		cursor: pointer;
		transition: background 0.2s, border-color 0.2s, color 0.2s;
	}

	.cookie-settings-btn:hover {
		background: #C9A84C;
		border-color: #C9A84C;
		color: #0A0A0A;
	}

	.cookies {
		padding: 8rem 0;
	}

	.container {
		max-width: 900px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 0 2rem;
	}

	h1 {
		font-size: 3rem;
		text-align: center;
		margin-bottom: 4rem;
	}

	.cookies-content {
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
		padding: 3rem;
		border-radius: 12px;
	}

	h2 {
		font-size: 1.8rem;
		color: var(--color-accent);
		margin: 2.5rem 0 1rem;
	}

	h2:first-child {
		margin-top: 0;
	}

	p {
		margin: 0.8rem 0;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	ul {
		margin: 1rem 0;
		padding-left: 2rem;
	}

	li {
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	a {
		color: var(--color-accent);
		text-decoration: underline;
		transition: color 0.3s;
	}

	a:hover {
		color: var(--color-white);
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.cookies {
			padding: 6rem 0;
		}

		h1 {
			font-size: 2.5rem;
			margin-bottom: 3rem;
		}

		.cookies-content {
			padding: 2rem;
		}

		h2 {
			font-size: 1.5rem;
		}
	}

	.cookies-content a {
		color: var(--color-accent);
		border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
		transition: border-color 0.2s ease;
	}
	.cookies-content a:hover {
		border-bottom-color: var(--color-accent);
	}
</style>
